.idea/

# Secret stuff
.env
.Renviron

# Quarto build cache (not output)
/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
**/quarto-session-temp*/

# Standalone slide output can appear next to qmd files when rendered directly.
/docs/slides/*.html
/docs/slides/*_files/

# Built site output — built by GitHub Actions, not committed
/_site/

# Quarto render leftovers
**/*.rmarkdown

# /docs/_freeze/ IS committed, but only for pages marked `freeze: true`.
# Everything else is executed from scratch by Actions. Today that means the
# TMDB chapter alone: it needs a personal token that must not reach CI, so
# the teacher renders it locally and commits the result.


# Standalone render can leave site_libs next to source
/docs/site_libs/
